    "items": [
      "Changing `WEAssassinTemplate` 1051FB leaves CC `ccBGSSSE038_AssassinDarkElf` at its own PC×1.1 [15–60]: it uses the template but not for `Stats` (it is a row of its own).",
      "The Hag's End assassin's level 1 is owned by `EncBandit01TemplateMelee` 039CFD, rung 01 of *Common Bandits*. Changing that owner also needs 25 records that keep their own level under it (they use it, a rung-01 leaf, or a wrapper on a bandit list that draws it, as template but not for `Stats`), among them `Vald` 072B04 (PC×1.2 [8–42], on *Thieves Guild Foes*), `DLC1EncHunterTemplate` 00336F:Dawnguard.esm (PC×1 [5–25], on *Common Dawnguard*), `ccEDHSSE003_RedguardEliteF01` 00081C:ccedhsse003-redguard.esl (48), `DLC2dunHaknir` 01A373:Dragonborn.esm (PC×1.25 [40–75]) and `ccKRTSSE001_Inimoro` 000A94:cckrtsse001_altar.esl (PC×1 [60–80]); they belong with the bandit rung, not this page.",
      "The Sanctuary Guardians carry `Stats` and follow the Forsworn wrappers; the records that keep their own level beside those wrappers are on the Forsworn pages.",
      "The other rows: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "Every other assassin record (the three leaves, `LvlWEAssassin`, CC `ccBGSSSE050_AssassinKhajiitF`) carries `Stats` and follows `WEAssassinTemplate` or `WEAssassinSubChar`."
    ]
  },
